msgstr ""

#: includes/abilities/media.php:268
msgid "ID of the attachment to read. An unknown ID, or one that is not an attachment, returns a generic error."
msgstr ""

#: includes/abilities/media.php:356
msgid "Exact MIME type to filter the breakdown to, for example image/jpeg. Omit to return the total and breakdown across every MIME type."
msgstr ""

#: includes/abilities/media.php:519
msgid "ID of the post whose featured image will be set. The caller must be able to edit this post."
msgstr ""

#: includes/abilities/media.php:524
msgid "ID of an existing image attachment to use as the featured image. Must already exist and genuinely be an image; a non-image or missing attachment is rejected."
