msgid "Lists the shipping methods configured in a WooCommerce shipping zone, given its zone id. Each method returns its instance id, type, title, enabled state, order, and per-instance settings. The settings object is the method's own configuration, so for a carrier or gateway plugin it can hold account details; field names matching a known secret pattern are removed before the response, but that check is a denylist and cannot cover every third-party naming. Requires the manage-WooCommerce capability."
msgstr ""

