msgid "Get WooCommerce shipping method"
msgstr ""

#: includes/abilities/woocommerce/shipping.php:107
msgid "Reads one shipping method from a WooCommerce shipping zone, given the zone id and the method's instance id. Returns its type, title, enabled state, order, and per-instance settings. The settings object is the method's own configuration, so for a carrier or gateway plugin it can hold account details; field names matching a known secret pattern are removed before the response, but that check is a denylist and cannot cover every third-party naming. Requires the manage-WooCommerce capability."
msgstr ""

#: includes/abilities/woocommerce/shipping.php:115
msgid "Create WooCommerce shipping method"
msgstr ""

#: includes/abilities/woocommerce/shipping.php:116
msgid "Adds a shipping method to a WooCommerce shipping zone. Provide the zone id and method type (e.g. flat_rate, free_shipping, local_pickup). A newly added method's cost is left at WooCommerce's own default (0 for flat_rate) until set; this plugin's abilities cannot write it, so set the method's cost in the WooCommerce admin under the zone's shipping method settings. Returns the new method shape. Requires the manage-WooCommerce capability."
msgstr ""

#: includes/abilities/woocommerce/shipping.php:124
msgid "Update WooCommerce shipping method"
msgstr ""

#: includes/abilities/woocommerce/shipping.php:125
msgid "Updates a shipping method in a WooCommerce shipping zone by zone id and instance id, changing only the fields you send (method_title, enabled). The method's cost cannot be changed through this plugin's abilities; set it in the WooCommerce admin under the zone's shipping method settings. Returns the updated method shape. Requires the manage-WooCommerce capability."
